{"headword":"מִדָּה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. measure, measurement, stature, size, garment</strong> (mostly late)—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:2\" href=\"/Exodus.26.2\">Ex 26:2</a> + 35 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.21\">Ez 40:21</a> + 2 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.17\">Ez 41:17</a> + 12 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדּוֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 133:2\" href=\"/Psalms.133.2\">ψ 133:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדּוֹתֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.16\">48:16</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>measure, act of measurement</em>, i.e. long measure <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.17\">Ez 41:17</a> (del. Co), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.15\">42:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.30\">48:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:33\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.33\">33</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:4\" href=\"/Joshua.3.4\">Jos 3:4</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.29\">1 Ch 23:29</a>, v. also <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.35\">Lv 19:35</a> (H); once of liquid measure, fig., <a data-ref=\"Job 28:25\" href=\"/Job.28.25\">Jb 28:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קַו֯ה הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:39\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.39\">Je 31:39</a> <em>measuring-line;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבֶל מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:5\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.5\">Zc 2:5</a> (<em>id.</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">קְנֵה הַמּ׳</span> <em>measuring-reed</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.3\">Ez 40:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.16\">42:16</a> (del. Co), v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.19\">19</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>measurement, size</em> of curtains in tabern. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:2\" href=\"/Exodus.26.2\">Ex 26:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:8\" href=\"/Exodus.26.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:9\" href=\"/Exodus.36.9\">36:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:15\" href=\"/Exodus.36.15\">15</a> (all P); cf. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.25\">1 K 6:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:37\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.37\">7:37</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶצֶב</span>), v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.3\">2 Ch 3:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.10\">Ez 40:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:32\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:33\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:35\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.35\">35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.13\">43:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.22\">46:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.16\">48:16</a>; once of time, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדַּת יָמַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:5\" href=\"/Psalms.39.5\">ψ 39:5</a>; prob. also <a data-ref=\"Job 11:9\" href=\"/Job.11.9\">Jb 11:9</a> (fig. of God’s wisdom) where <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדָּהּ</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדָּתָהּ</span>, cf. Sta<sup>§ 347, c. 2</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית מִדּוֹת</span> = <em>house of size</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.14\">Je 22:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מִדָּה</span> = <em>man of size, stature</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.23\">1 Ch 11:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.6\">20:6</a>; so also prob. ‖ <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.20\">2 S 21:20</a> (for ℌ <span dir=\"rtl\">מדין</span>, Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">מָדוֹן</span>, v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, מַד²\" href=\"/BDB,_מַד²\", dir=\"rtl\">מַד</a>]), We Dr Kit Bu; pl. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:32\" href=\"/Numbers.13.32\">Nu 13:32</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.14\">Is 45:14</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>measured portion, extent</em>, stretch (of wall) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.11\">Ne 3:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.30\">30</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.3\">Ez 45:3</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>garment</em> (pl. poet.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 133:2\" href=\"/Psalms.133.2\">ψ 133:2</a>."}],"num":"4."}]},"rid":"BDB05088","strong_numbers":["4060","4061"],"next_hw":"מֵמַד","prev_hw":"מַד²","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","quotes":[],"GK":["10402","4500","4501"],"TWOT":["1146b","1147"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":